sequenceDiagram
 actor User
 participant Input as Keyboard/Touch
 participant Game as Game Loop
 participant Mission as Mission Logic
 participant Traffic as Traffic Logic
 participant Audio as Audio System
 participant Canvas as Canvas Renderer
 User->>Input: Press Enter
 Input->>Game: reset(), state=play
 Game->>Mission: newMission()
 loop Each animation frame while playing
 Game->>Input: Read held keys
 Game->>Traffic: spawn(), move vehicles
 Traffic-->>Game: Vehicle positions
 Game->>Game: AABB collision check
 alt Collision and no invulnerability
 Game->>Game: hit(): lives--, score-=20
 Game->>Audio: sfx(crash)
 end
 Game->>Mission: Update distance, timer and zone
 opt Player stopped inside zone
 User->>Input: Space / hold brake
 Input->>Mission: tryDrop() / automatic drop
 Mission-->>Game: Fare, level++, next mission
 Game->>Audio: sfx(ding)
 end
 Game->>Canvas: drawBG(), drawPlayer(), drawHUD()
 end
